{"id":187,"flavor":[{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"This Pokémon drifts and floats with the wind. If it senses the approach of strong winds, Hoppip links its leaves with other Hoppip to prepare against being blown away."},{"games":["Y","White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"It drifts on winds. It is said that when Hoppip gather in fields and mountains, spring is on the way."},{"games":["X","SoulSilver","FireRed","Silver"],"text":"Its body is so light, it must grip the ground firmly with its feet to keep from being blown away."},{"games":["HeartGold"],"text":"To keep from being blown away by the wind, they gather in clusters. But they do enjoy gentle breezes."},{"games":["LeafGreen","Gold"],"text":"To keep from being blown away by the wind, they gather in clusters. They do enjoy gentle breezes, though."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"This POKéMON drifts and floats with the wind. If it senses the approach of strong winds, a HOPPIP links leaves with others to prepare against being blown away."},{"games":["Crystal"],"text":"It can be carried away on even the gentlest breeze. It may even float all the way to the next town."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Chlorophyll","hidden":false,"description":"Boosts the Pokémon's Speed stat in harsh sunlight."},{"name":"Leaf Guard","hidden":false,"description":"Prevents status conditions in harsh sunlight."},{"name":"Infiltrator","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon's moves are unaffected by the target's barriers, substitutes, and the like."}],"eggGroups":["Fairy","Grass"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium slow","habitat":"grassland","color":"Pink","shape":"Upright","evolution":{"id":187,"name":"Hoppip","condition":null,"children":[{"id":188,"name":"Skiploom","condition":"Lv. 18","children":[{"id":189,"name":"Jumpluff","condition":"Lv. 27","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,33],[1,150],[4,39],[6,71],